00:00:04,539 --> 00:00:08,198
Chapter 23.

2
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:13,420
Good morning," said the little prince.

3
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:17,319
"Good morning set the merchant.

4
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:22,539
This was the merchant who sold pills that had been invented to quench thirst.

5
00:00:22,539 --> 00:00:30,118
You need only swallow one pill a week, and you would feel no need of anything to drink.

6
00:00:30,219 --> 00:00:35,139
"Why are you selling these pills ask the little prince.

7
00:00:35,139 --> 00:00:40,979
"Because they save a tremendous amount of time," said the merchant.

8
00:00:40,979 --> 00:00:44,859
"Computations have been made by experts.

9
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:51,100
With these pills, you save 53 minutes in every week."

10
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:57,300
"And what do I do with 53 minutes thus saved

11
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:01,420
Anything you like..."

12
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:05,920
"As for me," said the little prince to himself,

13
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:10,600
"if I had 53 minutes time to spend as I liked,

14
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:17,460
I should walk at my leisure toward a spring of fresh water
